  "body_html": "<p>Indulge the book lover in your life with this uniquely personalized blanket from Jeminise. Designed for comfort and style, this blanket is the perfect companion for cozy reading sessions and makes a thoughtful gift to celebrate their passion for books.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Unique Gift for Book Lovers:</strong> A thoughtful and personal present that any book enthusiast will cherish, ideal for showcasing their love of reading.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Customizable Design:</strong> Make it truly special by adding personal details such as skin color, hairstyle, and name, creating a one-of-a-kind blanket.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches), ensuring a perfect fit for any cozy reading moment.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Perfect Gift Idea:</strong> An ideal gift for book lovers on occasions like birthdays, Christmas, or as a heartfelt surprise for a fellow reader.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Comfort and Style:</strong> A beautifully designed, personalized blanket that adds warmth and a touch of literary charm to any reading nook.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> This blanket is machine washable, making maintenance simple and convenient.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Crafted from soft and lightweight polyester for lasting comfort.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Book Lover Blanket 2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Letter Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Book</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), X-Large (80x60 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>Medium</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Dimensions</th>\n<td>60\"L x 50\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Age Range Description</th>\n<td>Adult</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
